At that moment, a woman came from behind Jesus. She had been suffering from a disease that caused her to bleed. It had been with her for twelve years. She touched the edge of his clothes.
I thought, "I just need to touch his clothes. Then I will be healed."
Jesus turned and saw her. He said, "Woman, you have great faith! Don't be afraid, just believe." And immediately the woman was healed.
When Jesus entered the ruler's house, he saw the pipers there. And he saw the noisy crowd.
